#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Saitunan Gabaɗaya"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Service Check Name"
msgstr "Sunan Binciken Sabis"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The name that is displayed for this Service Check, and is included in any Alert notifications."
msgstr "Sunan da ake nunawa don wannan Duba Sabis, kuma ana haɗa shi a cikin duk sanarwar Faɗakarwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many attempts"
msgstr "Yawan ƙoƙari nawa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Cacti attempts to run each test multiple times. The first successful attempt ends the testing and records the success. If none of the attempts are successful, the test is terminated and a failure is recorded. High number causes log test duration."
msgstr "Cacti yana ƙoƙarin gudanar da kowane gwaji sau da yawa. Yunƙuri na farko da ya yi nasara yana kawo ƙarshen gwajin kuma yana rubuta nasarar. Idan babu ko ɗaya daga cikin yunƙurin da ya yi nasara, za a dakatar da gwajin kuma a rubuta gazawa. Babban adadi yana haifar da tsawon lokacin gwajin rajista."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable test"
msgstr "Kunna gwaji"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Uncheck this box to disable this test from being checked."
msgstr "Cire alama a wannan akwatin don hana duba wannan gwajin."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable run script for this test"
msgstr "Kunna gudanar da rubutun umarni don wannan gwaji"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If the global Command Execution function is enabled, you can set here whether the script should be run for this test or not."
msgstr "Idan an kunna aikin Gudanar da Umarni na gaba ɗaya, za ka iya saita a nan ko ya kamata a gudanar da rubutun shirin don wannan gwajin ko a'a."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Poller"
msgstr "Mai Tattara Bayanai"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Poller on which the test will run"
msgstr "Mai Tattara Bayanai da gwajin zai gudana a kansa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Type of service"
msgstr "Nau'in sabis"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "What type of service?"
msgstr "Wane irin sabis ne?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "IP Address or DNS name of server"
msgstr "Adireshin IP ko sunan DNS na sabar"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "You can specify another port (example.com:5000) otherwise default will be used. For IPv6 numeric address use [ip:ad:dr:es:fo:rma:at]. For DOH (DNS over HTTPS) use here name of server (example 10.10.10.10, cloudflare-dns.com, ..)"
msgstr "Za ka iya ƙayyade wata tashar sadarwa (example.com:5000) in ba haka ba za a yi amfani da ta asali. Don adireshin lambobi na IPv6 yi amfani da [ip:ad:dr:es:fo:rma:at]. Don DOH (DNS over HTTPS) yi amfani da sunan uwar garke a nan (misali 10.10.10.10, cloudflare-dns.com, ..)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Resolve DNS to Address"
msgstr "Fassara DNS zuwa Adireshi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enter an IP Address to force DNS name to resolve to. Leaving blank will use DNS Resolution instead."
msgstr "Shigar da Adireshin IP don tilasta sunan DNS ya warware zuwa gare shi. Barin shi fanko zai yi amfani da Warwarewar DNS a madadin haka."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Service settings"
msgstr "Saitunan sabis"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Select correct credential"
msgstr "Zaɓi shaidar shiga daidai"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP OID"
msgstr "SNMP OID"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert SNMP OID"
msgstr "Shigar da SNMP OID"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSH command"
msgstr "Umarnin SSH"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert SSH command with full path, result of command will be returned"
msgstr "Shigar da umarnin SSH tare da cikakkiyar hanya, za a dawo da sakamakon umarnin"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Your own CA and intermediate certs"
msgstr "Takardun shaidar CA naka da na tsaka-tsaki"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP Search"
msgstr "Binciken LDAP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP search filter, it could be ,OU=anygroup,DC=example,DC=com"
msgstr "Tacewar binciken LDAP, zai iya zama ,OU=anygroup,DC=example,DC=com"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "DNS Name for Query"
msgstr "Sunan DNS don Tambaya"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "DNS name for querying. For DOH (DNS over HTTPS) use /resolve?name=example.com or /dns-query?name=example.com&type=A. For plaintext DNS A and AAAA records will be returned"
msgstr "Sunan DNS don yin tambaya. Don DOH (DNS ta kan HTTPS) yi amfani da /resolve?name=example.com ko /dns-query?name=example.com&type=A. Don rubutu na fili za a dawo da bayanan DNS A da AAAA"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Path Part of URL"
msgstr "Sashen Hanya na URL"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For web service insert at least \"/\" or something like \"/any/path/\"."
msgstr "Don sabis na yanar gizo shigar da aƙalla \"/\" ko wani abu kamar \"/kowace/hanya/\"."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Requires Authentication"
msgstr "Yana Buƙatar Tantancewa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check this box if the site will normally return a 401 Error as it requires a username and password."
msgstr "Yi alama a wannan akwatin idan wurin yakan dawo da Kuskuren 401 saboda yana buƙatar sunan mai amfani da kalmar sirri."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Proxy Server"
msgstr "Sabar Wakili"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If this connection text requires a proxy, select it here.  Otherwise choose 'None'."
msgstr "Idan wannan rubutun haɗi yana buƙatar proxy, zaɓe shi a nan. In ba haka ba zaɓi 'Babu'."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check Certificate"
msgstr "Duba Takardar Shaida"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If using SSL, check this box if you want to validate the certificate. Default on, turn off if you the site uses a self-signed certificate."
msgstr "Idan ana amfani da SSL, zaɓi wannan akwati idan kana son tabbatar da ingancin takardar shaida. Yana kunne ta tsoho, kashe idan wurin yana amfani da takardar shaida da aka sa wa hannu da kai."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check and notify Certificate expiration"
msgstr "Duba kuma ka sanar da ƙarewar Takardar Shaida"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If using SSL, check this box if you want to check the certificate expiration. You can set in settings how many days before expiration notify.."
msgstr "Idan ana amfani da SSL, zaɓi wannan akwati idan kana son duba ƙarewar takardar shaida. Za ka iya saita a cikin saituna adadin kwanaki nawa kafin ƙarewa za a sanar.."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Sigogi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How Often to Test"
msgstr "Sau Nawa Za a Gwada"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Test every xth poller run"
msgstr "Gwada a kowane zagaye na x na Mai Tattara Bayanai"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Trigger"
msgstr "Mai Tada Aiki"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many times the service must be DOWN before an alert email is triggered."
msgstr "Sau nawa dole ne sabis ɗin ya kasance A KASHE kafin a kunna imel na faɗakarwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Long duration alert"
msgstr "Faɗakarwar tsawon lokaci mai tsawo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If the test time is greater than this value more times in a row, send a notification. Related to variable Duration count. The test inherits the maximum runtime from the settings. If a higher value is set here, the maximum runtime is this value + 2 seconds."
msgstr "Idan lokacin gwajin ya fi wannan ƙimar yawa a jere, a aika sanarwa. Yana da alaƙa da adadin Tsawon Lokaci (Duration count). Gwajin yana gadon matsakaicin lokacin gudu daga saituna. Idan an saita ƙima mafi girma a nan, matsakaicin lokacin gudu shine wannan ƙima + daƙiƙa 2."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Number of duration violations in a row"
msgstr "Adadin keta tsawon lokaci a jere"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many times the duration trigger must be exceeded in a row for a notification to be sent"
msgstr "Sau nawa dole ne a wuce ƙayyadadden lokacin a jere kafin a aika da sanarwa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Verification Strings"
msgstr "Jumlolin Tabbatarwa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String"
msgstr "Kalmomin Binciken Amsa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for in the response for a live and working service."
msgstr "Wannan ita ce jimlar da za a bincika a cikin amsa don sabis da ke raye kuma yana aiki."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String - Maintenance"
msgstr "Kalmomin Binciken Amsa - Kulawa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for on the Maintenance .  The Service Check will check for this string if the above string is not found.  If found, it means that the service is under maintenance."
msgstr "Wannan ita ce jimlar da za a bincika a kan Kulawa . Binciken Sabis zai bincika wannan jimlar idan ba a sami jimlar da ke sama ba. Idan an same ta, yana nufin cewa sabis ɗin yana ƙarƙashin gyara."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String - Failed"
msgstr "Kalmomin Binciken Amsa - Ya Gaza"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for a known failure in the service response.  The Service Check will only alert if this string is found, ignoring any timeout issues and the search strings above."
msgstr "Wannan ita ce jimlar da za a bincika don sanannen gazawa a cikin amsar sabis. Binciken Sabis zai yi faɗakarwa ne kawai idan an sami wannan jimlar, tare da yin watsi da duk wata matsalar ƙarewar lokaci da jimlolin bincike na sama."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Notification Settings"
msgstr "Saitunan Sanarwa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Email notification"
msgstr "Sanarwar imel"

#: includes/arrays.php
