#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "<b>Can be used for a lot of service checks:</b><br/><i>Http/https</i> - optional, when it is set, try HTTP basic auth<br/><i>SMTP on port 587</i> - optional. Without a username/password, only the server response is tested. With a username and password, login is also performed<br/><i>Imap, imaps, pop3, pop3s, ftp</i> - optional. For anonymous ftp, use username \"anonymous\" and email address as password<br/><i>LDAP, smb, smbs</i> - required<br/><i>MQTT</i> - optional<br/><i>SCP, SSH command</i> - you can use this method or private key method"
msgstr "<b>Ana iya amfani da shi don binciken ayyuka da yawa:</b><br/><i>Http/https</i> - na zaɓi ne, idan an saita shi, a gwada tantancewar asali ta HTTP<br/><i>SMTP akan tashar 587</i> - na zaɓi ne. Idan babu sunan mai amfani/kalmar sirri, ana gwada martanin sabar ne kawai. Idan akwai sunan mai amfani da kalmar sirri, ana kuma yin shiga<br/><i>Imap, imaps, pop3, pop3s, ftp</i> - na zaɓi ne. Don ftp na baƙo, a yi amfani da sunan mai amfani \"anonymous\" da adireshin imel a matsayin kalmar sirri<br/><i>LDAP, smb, smbs</i> - ana buƙata<br/><i>MQTT</i> - na zaɓi ne<br/><i>Umurnin SCP, SSH</i> - kuna iya amfani da wannan hanyar ko hanyar maɓallin sirri"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - Basic HTTP auth. Username and password are required"
msgstr "Rest API - Tantancewar HTTP ta asali. Ana buƙatar sunan mai amfani da kalmar sirri"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - API key auth<br/>Auth is sent in HTTP header, custom header or POST method. Credentials in URL are not supported.<br/>Insert API key name and value. Both values are required. For HTTP header the name <i>Bearer or apikey or \"\"</i> is usually used (Authorization: Bearer apivalue). For custom header <i>X-API-Key</i> is usually used (X-Api-Key: keyvalue). For POST <i>api_key</i> is usually used."
msgstr "Rest API - Tantancewar maɓallin API<br/>Ana aika tantancewa a cikin kan HTTP, keɓaɓɓen kai ko hanyar POST. Ba a tallafawa bayanan shiga a cikin URL.<br/>Shigar da sunan maɓallin API da ƙimarsa. Ana buƙatar duka ƙimomin biyu. Ga kan HTTP ana yawan amfani da sunan <i>Bearer ko apikey ko \"\"</i> (Authorization: Bearer apivalue). Ga keɓaɓɓen kai ana yawan amfani da <i>X-API-Key</i> (X-Api-Key: keyvalue). Ga POST ana yawan amfani da <i>api_key</i>."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - OAuth2/Bearer token auth<br/>You can have key/token from server and insert it here or use auth flow with credentials. Username and password are sent Json encoded."
msgstr "Rest API - Tantancewar alamar OAuth2/Bearer<br/>Za ka iya samun maɓalli/alama daga uwar garke ka shigar da shi nan ko ka yi amfani da tsarin tantancewa tare da bayanan shiga. Ana aika sunan mai amfani da kalmar sirri a tsarin Json."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - Cookie based auth - both values are required. After login, cookie is returned"
msgstr "Rest API - Tantancewa mai dogaro da Cookie - ana buƙatar duka ƙimomin biyu. Bayan shiga, ana dawo da cookie"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP v1 or v2 - required, insert community name here"
msgstr "SNMP v1 ko v2 - ana buƙata, shigar da sunan al'umma a nan"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP v3 - The security level determines which parameters are required"
msgstr "SNMP v3 - Matsayin tsaro ne ke tantance waɗanne sigogi ake buƙata"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSH private key - Can be used for SCP or SSH command test. These test can use username/password too"
msgstr "Maɓallin sirri na SSH - Ana iya amfani da shi don gwajin SCP ko umarnin SSH. Waɗannan gwaje-gwaje na iya amfani da sunan mai amfani/kalmar sirri su ma"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "It only checks whether the web server is responding. If username/password credential is used, it will try Basic HTTP auth."
msgstr "Yana duba ko uwar garken yanar gizo tana amsawa kawai. Idan aka yi amfani da bayanan shiga na sunan mai amfani/kalmar sirri, zai gwada Basic HTTP auth."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The same as HTTP plaintext but adds the ability to test certificates."
msgstr "Daidai yake da rubutun HTTP na fili amma yana ƙara ikon gwada takaddun shaida."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "It only checks whether the SMTP server is responding. No authentication. You will see server login banner and ehlo response."
msgstr "Yana duba ko uwar garken SMTP tana amsawa kawai. Babu tantancewa. Za ku ga allon shiga na uwar garken da martanin ehlo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted + STARTTLS. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate. Without username and password, you will see server login banner and ehlo response. With credential, login will be performed"
msgstr "Ba a ɓoye ba + STARTTLS. Haka kuma yana yiwuwa a gwada ingancin takardar shaidar. Ba tare da sunan mai amfani da kalmar sirri ba, za ku ga allon shiga na uwar garke da amsar ehlo. Tare da shaidar shiga, za a yi shiga"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted connection on default port 465. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate. With username and password AUTH LOGIN will be tested."
msgstr "Haɗi mai rufaffen tsaro a tashar jiragen ruwa ta asali 465. Hakanan yana yiwuwa a gwada ingancin takardar shaida. Tare da sunan mai amfani da kalmar sirri za a gwada AUTH LOGIN."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted IMAP connection. Without credential, only connection will be tested. You will see only login banner. With credential login will be tested and try to read list of messages. You can use AUTHENTICATE PLAIN or AUTHENTICATE LOGIN method."
msgstr "Haɗin IMAP wanda ba a ɓoye ba. Ba tare da shaidar shiga ba, za a gwada haɗin ne kawai. Za ku ga allon shiga kawai. Tare da shaidar shiga za a gwada shiga a kuma yi ƙoƙarin karanta jerin saƙonni. Za ku iya amfani da hanyar AUTHENTICATE PLAIN ko AUTHENTICATE LOGIN."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The same as unencrypted IMAP but after login STARTTLS is used. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate after STARTTLS."
msgstr "Daidai yake da IMAP mara ɓoye amma bayan shiga ana amfani da STARTTLS. Hakanan yana yiwuwa a gwada ingancin takardar shaidar bayan STARTTLS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted IMAP, you can try login and test certificate and user login"
msgstr "IMAP mai rufaffen tsaro, za ka iya gwada shiga kuma ka gwada takardar shaida da shigar mai amfani"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted POP3 connection. Without credential, only connection will be tested. You will see only login banner. With credential login will be tested and try to read list of messages"
msgstr "Haɗin POP3 wanda ba a ɓoye ba. Ba tare da shaidar shiga ba, za a gwada haɗin ne kawai. Za ku ga allon shiga kawai. Tare da shaidar shiga za a gwada shiga a kuma yi ƙoƙarin karanta jerin saƙonni"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The same as unencrypted POP3 but after login STARTTLS is used. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate after STARTTLS."
msgstr "Daidai yake da POP3 mara ɓoye amma bayan shiga ana amfani da STARTTLS. Hakanan yana yiwuwa a gwada ingancin takardar shaidar bayan STARTTLS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted POP3, you can try login and test certificate and user login."
msgstr "POP3 mai rufaffen tsaro, za ka iya gwada shiga kuma ka gwada takardar shaida da shigar mai amfani."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try to resolve DNS record on specified DNS server"
msgstr "Gwada warware bayanan DNS a kan sabar DNS da aka ƙayyade"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try DNS over HTTPS."
msgstr "Gwada DNS ta hanyar HTTPS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "All parameters are required. Perform unencrypted LDAP login and search"
msgstr "Ana buƙatar duk sigogi. Yi shigar LDAP mara rufaffen tsaro da bincike"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "All parameters are required. Perform encrypted LDAP login and search"
msgstr "Ana buƙatar duk sigogi. Yi shigar LDAP mai rufaffen tsaro da bincike"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted FTP connection, login and try to download file specified in path (/path/to/file.txt). For anonymous connection use login *anonymous* and email address as password. The content of the file is returned."
msgstr "Haɗin FTP wanda ba a ɓoye ba, shiga sannan ka yi ƙoƙarin sauke fayil ɗin da aka ƙayyade a hanya (/path/to/file.txt). Don haɗin ɓoyayye yi amfani da sunan shiga *anonymous* da adireshin imel a matsayin kalmar sirri. Za a dawo da abin da ke cikin fayil ɗin."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try to download file specified in path (/path/to/file.txt) from TFTP server. The content of the file is returned."
msgstr "Gwada sauke fayil ɗin da aka ƙayyade a hanya (/path/to/file.txt) daga sabar TFTP. Ana dawo da abin da ke cikin fayil ɗin."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted SCP connection, login and try to download file specified in path (/path/to/file.txt)."
msgstr "Haɗin SCP mai rufaffen tsaro, shiga kuma ka gwada sauke fayil ɗin da aka ƙayyade a hanya (/path/to/file.txt)."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try SMB protocol, username and password are required. Try to login and download file."
msgstr "Gwada ƙa'idar SMB, ana buƙatar sunan mai amfani da kalmar sirri. Gwada shiga kuma ka sauke fayil."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Connect to MQTT server and listen for any message. You can specify topic in Path (bedroom/temp), blank for any topic. For this test is recommended increase \"Long duration alert\""
msgstr "Haɗa zuwa uwar garken MQTT ka saurari kowane saƙo. Za ka iya ƙayyade maudu'i a cikin Hanya (bedroom/temp), a bar shi fanko don kowane maudu'i. Don wannan gwajin ana ba da shawarar ƙara \"Faɗakarwar dogon lokaci\""

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with basic HTTP auth. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Gwajin REST API tare da tantancewar HTTP ta asali. Shirya bayanan shiga tukuna."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with API key auth. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Gwajin REST API tare da tantancewar maɓallin API. Shirya bayanan shiga tukuna."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with Oauth2. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Gwajin REST API tare da Oauth2. Shirya bayanan shiga tukuna."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with cookie auth. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Gwajin REST API tare da tantancewar kuki. Shirya bayanan shiga tukuna."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try SNMP get method. Output for specified OID is returned. Credential is required, you have to prepare SNMP v.1,2 or v3 credential first."
msgstr "Gwada hanyar SNMP get. Ana dawo da sakamako don OID da aka ƙayyade. Ana buƙatar shaidar shiga, dole ne ka shirya shaidar SNMP v.1,2 ko v3 da farko."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try SNMP walk method. Output for specified OID is returned. Credential is required, you have to prepare SNMP v.1,2 or v3 credential first."
msgstr "Gwada hanyar SNMP walk. Ana dawo da sakamako don OID da aka ƙayyade. Ana buƙatar shaidar shiga, dole ne ka shirya shaidar SNMP v.1,2 ko v3 da farko."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Use ssh and connect to remote host. After login run specified command and return output. Username and password or private key is possible."
msgstr "Yi amfani da ssh ka haɗa da mai masauki na nesa. Bayan shiga, gudanar da umarnin da aka ƙayyade kuma mayar da sakamako. Ana iya amfani da sunan mai amfani da kalmar sirri ko maɓallin sirri."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SFTP protocol on port 22, username and password and path are required. Try to do directory listing of path."
msgstr "Ka'idar SFTP akan tasha 22, ana buƙatar sunan mai amfani da kalmar sirri da hanya. Gwada yin jerin kundin fayiloli na hanyar."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "All fine. Proceed as usual."
msgstr "Komai lafiya. Ci gaba kamar yadda aka saba."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The URL you passed to libcurl used a protocol that this libcurl does not support. The support might be a compile-time option that you did not use, it can be a misspelled protocol string or just a protocol libcurl has no code for."
msgstr "URL ɗin da ka tura zuwa libcurl yana amfani da ka'idar da wannan libcurl ba ta tallafawa. Tallafin zai iya zama zaɓi na lokacin haɗawa da ba ka yi amfani da shi ba, ko kuskuren rubutun ka'idar ko kuma ka'idar da libcurl ba ta da lambar ta."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Early initialization code failed. This is likely to be an internal error or problem, or a resource problem where something fundamental could not get done at init time."
msgstr "Lambar farawa ta farko ta kasa. Wannan na iya zama kuskure ko matsala ta ciki, ko matsalar albarkatun tsari inda ba a iya yin wani muhimmin abu a lokacin farawa ba."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The URL was not properly formatted."
msgstr "Ba a tsara URL ɗin yadda ya kamata ba."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A requested feature, protocol or option was not found built-in in this libcurl due to a build-time decision. This means that a feature or option was not enabled or explicitly disabled when libcurl was built and in order to get it to function you have to get a rebuilt libcurl."
msgstr "Ba a sami siffa, ƙa'ida ko zaɓin da aka buƙata a ciki a wannan libcurl ba saboda shawarar da aka yanke lokacin ginawa. Wannan yana nufin cewa ba a kunna siffa ko zaɓi ba ko kuma an kashe shi da gangan lokacin da aka gina libcurl kuma don ya yi aiki dole ne a sami libcurl ɗin da aka sake ginawa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Could not resolve proxy. The given proxy host could not be resolved."
msgstr "Ba a iya gano wakilin hanyar sadarwa (proxy) ba. Ba a gano mai masaukin proxy da aka bayar ba."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Could not resolve host. The given remote host was not resolved."
msgstr "Ba a iya gano mai masauki ba. Ba a gano mai masauki na nesa da aka bayar ba."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to connect() to host or proxy."
msgstr "An kasa haɗa connect() zuwa mai masauki ko proxy."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The server sent data libcurl could not parse. This error code was known as CURLE_FTP_WEIRD_SERVER_REPLY before 7.51.0."
msgstr "Uwar garken ta aika da bayanan da libcurl ba ta iya tantancewa ba. Ana kiran wannan lambar kuskure da CURLE_FTP_WEIRD_SERVER_REPLY kafin 7.51.0."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "We were denied access to the resource given in the URL. For FTP, this occurs while trying to change to the remote directory."
msgstr "An hana mu damar shiga albarkatun da aka bayar a cikin URL. Ga FTP, wannan yana faruwa yayin ƙoƙarin canzawa zuwa kundin adireshi na nesa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "While waiting for the server to connect back when an active FTP session is used, an error code was sent over the control connection or similar."
msgstr "Yayin jiran uwar garken ta sake haɗawa lokacin da ake amfani da zaman FTP mai aiki, an aika lambar kuskure ta hanyar haɗin sarrafawa ko makamancin haka."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "After having sent the FTP password to the server, libcurl expects a proper reply. This error code indicates that an unexpected code was returned."
msgstr "Bayan an aika kalmar sirri ta FTP zuwa uwar garke, libcurl tana tsammanin amsa mai kyau. Wannan lambar kuskure tana nuna cewa an dawo da lamba da ba a yi tsammani ba."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "During an active FTP session while waiting for the server to connect, the CURLOPT_ACCEPTTIMEOUT_MS (or the internal default) timeout expired."
msgstr "A lokacin zaman FTP mai aiki yayin jiran uwar garken ta haɗu, wa'adin CURLOPT_ACCEPTTIMEOUT_MS (ko tsohon wa'adin ciki) ya ƙare."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Libcurl failed to get a sensible result back from the server as a response to either a PASV or a EPSV command. The server is flawed."
msgstr "Libcurl ya kasa samun sakamako mai ma'ana daga uwar garke a matsayin martani ga umarnin PASV ko EPSV. Uwar garken tana da matsala."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "FTP servers return a 227-line as a response to a PASV command. If libcurl fails to parse that line, this return code is passed back."
msgstr "Sabobin FTP suna dawo da layin 227 a matsayin amsa ga umarnin PASV. Idan libcurl ya kasa fassara wannan layin, ana mayar da wannan lambar dawowa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An internal failure to lookup the host used for the new connection."
msgstr "Kuskuren ciki wajen nemo mai masaukin da aka yi amfani da shi don sabon haɗin."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A problem was detected in the HTTP2 framing layer. This is somewhat generic and can be one out of several problems, see the error buffer for details."
msgstr "An gano matsala a matakin tsara HTTP2. Wannan na gama-gari ne kuma yana iya zama ɗaya daga cikin matsaloli da dama, duba wurin ajiyar kuskure don ƙarin bayani."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Received an error when trying to set the transfer mode to binary or ASCII."
msgstr "An sami kuskure yayin ƙoƙarin saita yanayin aikawa zuwa binary ko ASCII."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A file transfer was shorter or larger than expected. This happens when the server first reports an expected transfer size, and then delivers data that does not match the previously given size."
msgstr "Aika fayil ya kasance ƙanƙani ko babba fiye da yadda aka zata. Wannan yana faruwa ne lokacin da sabar ta fara ba da rahoton girman da ake tsammani, sannan ta aika bayanan da ba su yi daidai da girman da aka bayar a baya ba."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This was either a weird reply to a 'RETR' command or a zero byte transfer complete."
msgstr "Wannan ko dai wata baƙuwar amsa ce ga umarnin 'RETR' ko kuma cikar jigilar baiti sifili."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Obsolete Error"
msgstr "Tsohon Kuskure"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Not used in modern versions."
msgstr "Ba a amfani da shi a sababbin sigogi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When sending custom \"QUOTE\" commands to the remote server, one of the commands returned an error code that was 400 or higher (for FTP) or otherwise indicated unsuccessful completion of the command."
msgstr "Lokacin aikawa da umarnin \"QUOTE\" na musamman zuwa uwar garken nesa, ɗaya daga cikin umarnin ya dawo da lambar kuskure wadda ta kai 400 ko fiye (don FTP) ko kuma ta nuna rashin nasarar kammala umarnin."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is returned if CURLOPT_FAILONERROR is set true and the HTTP server returns an error code that is >= 400."
msgstr "Ana dawo da wannan idan an saita CURLOPT_FAILONERROR zuwa gaskiya kuma sabar HTTP ta dawo da lambar kuskure wadda ta kai >= 400."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An error occurred when writing received data to a local file, or an error was returned to libcurl from a write callback."
msgstr "Kuskure ya faru yayin rubuta bayanan da aka karɓa zuwa fayil na gida, ko kuma an dawo da kuskure zuwa libcurl daga aikin rubutu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed starting the upload. For FTP, the server typically denied the STOR command. The error buffer usually contains the server's explanation for this."
msgstr "An kasa fara lodawa. Ga FTP, uwar garken yawanci yana hana umarnin STOR. Wurin adana kuskuren yawanci yana ɗauke da bayanin uwar garken game da wannan."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "There was a problem reading a local file or an error returned by the read callback."
msgstr "An samu matsala wajen karanta fayil na gida ko kuma an dawo da kuskure ta hanyar kiran karatu (read callback)."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A memory allocation request failed. This is serious badness and things are severely screwed up if this ever occurs."
msgstr "Buƙatar keɓe ƙwaƙwalwar ajiya (memory allocation) ta kasa. Wannan babbar matsala ce kuma abubuwa sun lalace sosai idan wannan ya taɓa faruwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Operation timeout. The specified time-out period was reached according to the conditions."
msgstr "Lokacin aiki ya ƙare. An kai ƙayyadadden lokacin ƙarewa bisa ga sharuɗɗan."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The FTP PORT command returned error. This mostly happens when you have not specified a good enough address for libcurl to use. See CURLOPT_FTPPORT."
msgstr "Umarnin FTP PORT ya dawo da kuskure. Wannan yawanci yana faruwa idan ba ka bayyana adireshi mai kyau sosai da libcurl zai yi amfani da shi ba. Duba CURLOPT_FTPPORT."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The FTP REST command returned error. This should never happen if the server is sane."
msgstr "Umarnin FTP REST ya dawo da kuskure. Bai kamata wannan ya taɓa faruwa ba idan sabar tana aiki lafiya."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The server does not support or accept range requests."
msgstr "Uwar garken ba ta goyon baya ko karɓar buƙatun iyaka (range requests) ba."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is an odd error that mainly occurs due to internal confusion."
msgstr "Wannan kuskure ne mai ban mamaki wanda galibi ke faruwa saboda ruɗanin ciki."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A problem occurred somewhere in the SSL/TLS handshake. You really want the error buffer and read the message there as it pinpoints the problem slightly more. Could be certificates (file formats, paths, permissions), passwords, and others."
msgstr "Matsala ta faru a wani wuri a cikin haɗin SSL/TLS handshake. Lallai kana buƙatar duba wurin ajiyar kuskure (error buffer) kuma ka karanta saƙon da ke ciki domin yana nuna matsalar da kyau. Zai iya zama takaddun shaida (tsarin fayil, hanyoyi, izini), kalmomin sirri, da sauransu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The download could not be resumed because the specified offset was out of the file boundary."
msgstr "Ba a iya ci gaba da saukarwa ba saboda matsugunin da aka ayyana ya wuce iyakar fayil ɗin."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A file given with FILE:// could not be opened. Most likely because the file path does not identify an existing file. Did you check file permissions?"
msgstr "Ba a iya buɗe fayil ɗin da aka bayar da FILE:// ba. Mai yiwuwa saboda hanyar fayil ɗin ba ta nuna fayil ɗin da ke akwai ba. Shin kun duba izinin fayil ɗin?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP cannot bind. LDAP bind operation failed."
msgstr "LDAP ba zai iya haɗawa ba. Aikin haɗa LDAP ya gaza."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP search failed."
msgstr "Binciken LDAP ya gaza."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Function not found. A required zlib function was not found."
msgstr "Ba a sami aiki ba. Ba a sami wani aikin zlib da ake buƙata ba."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Aborted by callback. A callback returned \"abort\" to libcurl."
msgstr "An soke ta hanyar kiran baya (callback). Kiran baya ya mayar da \"abort\" zuwa libcurl."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A function was called with a bad parameter."
msgstr "An kira wani aiki (function) tare da mummunan siga (parameter)."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Interface error. A specified outgoing interface could not be used. Set which interface to use for outgoing connections' source IP address with URLOPT_INTERFACE."
msgstr "Kuskuren mahaɗa. Ba a iya amfani da mahaɗar fita da aka ƙayyade ba. Saita wace mahaɗa za a yi amfani da ita don adireshin IP na tushen haɗin fita da URLOPT_INTERFACE."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Too many redirects. When following redirects, libcurl hit the maximum amount. Set your limit with CURLOPT_MAXREDIRS."
msgstr "Juyawa zuwa wani adireshin sun yi yawa. Yayin bin juyawa, libcurl ya kai iyakar adadi. Saita iyakarka da CURLOPT_MAXREDIRS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An option passed to libcurl is not recognized/known. Refer to the appropriate documentation. This is most likely a problem in the program that uses libcurl. The error buffer might contain more specific information about which exact option it concerns."
msgstr "Ba a gane/san zaɓin da aka aika zuwa libcurl ba. Duba takardun bayani da suka dace. Wannan mai yiwuwa matsala ce a cikin shirin da ke amfani da libcurl. Ma'adanar kuskure na iya ƙunsar takamaiman bayani game da ainihin zaɓin da abin ya shafa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An option passed in to a setopt was wrongly formatted. See error message for details about what option."
msgstr "An tsara zaɓin da aka aika zuwa setopt ba daidai ba. Duba saƙon kuskure don ƙarin bayani game da ko wane zaɓi ne."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Nothing was returned from the server, and under the circumstances, getting nothing is considered an error."
msgstr "Ba a dawo da komai daga uwar garken ba, kuma a wannan yanayin, rashin samun komai ana ɗaukar sa a matsayin kuskure."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The specified crypto engine was not found."
msgstr "Ba a sami injin ɓoyewa (crypto engine) da aka ƙayyade ba."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed setting the selected SSL crypto engine as default."
msgstr "An kasa saita injin ɓoyewa na SSL da aka zaɓa a matsayin tsoho."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed sending network data."
msgstr "An kasa aika bayanan hanyar sadarwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failure with receiving network data."
msgstr "An sami matsala wajen karɓar bayanan hanyar sadarwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "problem with the local client certificate."
msgstr "matsala tare da takardar shaidar abokin ciniki na gida."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Could not use specified cipher."
msgstr "Ba a iya amfani da tsarin ɓoyewa da aka ƙayyade ba."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The remote server's SSL certificate or SSH fingerprint was deemed not OK. This error code has been unified with CURLE_SSL_CACERT since 7.62.0. Its previous value was 51."
msgstr "Takardar shaidar SSL ta uwar garken nesa ko sawun yatsan SSH an ga ba daidai ba ne. An haɗa wannan lambar kuskure tare da CURLE_SSL_CACERT tun daga 7.62.0. Darajarta ta baya ita ce 51."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unrecognized transfer encoding."
msgstr "Tsarin tura bayanai da ba a gane shi ba."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Maximum file size exceeded."
msgstr "An wuce mafi girman girman fayil."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Requested FTP SSL level failed."
msgstr "Matakin FTP SSL da aka buƙata ya gaza."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When doing a send operation curl had to rewind the data to retransmit, but the rewinding operation failed."
msgstr "Lokacin yin aikin aikawa curl ya buƙaci mayar da bayanan baya don sake aikawa, amma aikin mayar da bayanan baya ya gaza."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Initiating the SSL Engine failed."
msgstr "Fara injin SSL ya gaza."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The remote server denied curl to login (Added in 7.13.1)"
msgstr "Uwar garken nesa ta hana curl shiga (An ƙara a 7.13.1)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "File not found on TFTP server."
msgstr "Ba a sami fayil a kan uwar garken TFTP ba."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Permission problem on TFTP server."
msgstr "Matsalar izini akan sabar TFTP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Out of disk space on the server."
msgstr "Sararin diski ya ƙare a kan saba."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Illegal TFTP operation."
msgstr "Aikin TFTP da bai dace ba."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unknown TFTP transfer ID."
msgstr "ID na tura TFTP da ba a sani ba."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "File already exists and is not overwritten."
msgstr "Fayil ɗin ya riga ya wanzu kuma ba a rubuta a kansa ba."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This error should never be returned by a properly functioning TFTP server."
msgstr "Bai kamata sabar TFTP da ke aiki yadda ya kamata ta taɓa dawo da wannan kuskuren ba."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Problem with reading the SSL CA cert (path? access rights?)"
msgstr "Matsala wajen karanta takardar shaidar SSL CA (hanya? haƙƙoƙin shiga?)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The resource referenced in the URL does not exist."
msgstr "Abubuwan da aka yi nuni da su a cikin URL ba su wanzu ba."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An unspecified error occurred during the SSH session."
msgstr "Kuskuren da ba a tantance ba ya faru yayin zaman SSH."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to shut down the SSL connection."
msgstr "An kasa rufe haɗin SSL."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Socket is not ready for send/recv wait till it's ready and try again. This return code is only returned from curl_easy_recv and curl_easy_send (Added in 7.18.2)"
msgstr "Socket ba ta shirya don aikawa/karɓa ba, jira har sai ta shirya sannan ka sake gwadawa. Ana dawo da wannan lambar sakamako ne kawai daga curl_easy_recv da curl_easy_send (An ƙara a 7.18.2)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to load CRL file (Added in 7.19.0)"
msgstr "An kasa loda fayil ɗin CRL (An ƙara a 7.19.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Issuer check failed (Added in 7.19.0)"
msgstr "Binciken mai bayarwa ya gaza (An ƙara a 7.19.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The FTP server does not understand the PRET command at all or does not support the given argument. Be careful when using CURLOPT_CUSTOMREQUEST, a custom LIST command is sent with the PRET command before PASV as well. (Added in 7.20.0)"
msgstr "Sabar FTP ba ta fahimtar umarnin PRET kwata-kwata ko ba ta goyon bayan hujjar da aka bayar. Yi hankali yayin amfani da CURLOPT_CUSTOMREQUEST, ana aika umarnin LIST na musamman tare da umarnin PRET kafin PASV shima. (An ƙara a 7.20.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Mismatch of RTSP CSeq numbers."
msgstr "Rashin daidaiton lambobin RTSP CSeq."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Mismatch of RTSP Session Identifiers."
msgstr "Rashin daidaiton Masu Gano Zama na RTSP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unable to parse FTP file list (during FTP wildcard downloading)."
msgstr "An kasa fassara jerin fayilolin FTP (yayin sauke fayiloli na wildcard na FTP)."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Chunk callback reported error."
msgstr "Kiran mayarwa na yanki ya ba da rahoton kuskure."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "(For internal use only, is never returned by libcurl) No connection available, the session is queued. (added in 7.30.0)"
msgstr "(Don amfanin ciki kawai, libcurl ba ya dawo da shi) Babu haɗin da ake da shi, an saka zaman a layi. (an ƙara a 7.30.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to match the pinned key specified with CURLOPT_PINNEDPUBLICKEY."
msgstr "An kasa daidaita maɓallin da aka manna wanda aka ƙayyade da CURLOPT_PINNEDPUBLICKEY."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Status returned failure when asked with CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYSTATUS."
msgstr "Matsayin ya dawo da gazawa lokacin da aka tambaya da CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYSTATUS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Stream error in the HTTP/2 framing layer."
msgstr "Kuskuren rafi a ɓangaren tsarin HTTP/2."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An API function was called from inside a callback."
msgstr "An kira aikin API daga cikin aikin komowa (callback)."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An authentication function returned an error."
msgstr "Aikin tantancewa ya dawo da kuskure."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A problem was detected in the HTTP/3 layer. This is somewhat generic and can be one out of several problems, see the error buffer for details."
msgstr "An gano matsala a matakin HTTP/3. Wannan na gama-gari ne kuma yana iya zama ɗaya daga cikin matsaloli da dama, duba wurin ajiyar kuskure don ƙarin bayani."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "QUIC connection error. This error may be caused by an SSL library error. QUIC is the protocol used for HTTP/3 transfers."
msgstr "Kuskuren haɗin QUIC. Wannan kuskuren na iya kasancewa saboda kuskuren ɗakin karatu na SSL. QUIC ita ce ka'idar da ake amfani da ita don musayar HTTP/3."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Proxy handshake error. CURLINFO_PROXY_ERROR provides extra details on the specific problem."
msgstr "Kuskuren musafahar proxy. CURLINFO_PROXY_ERROR yana ba da ƙarin bayani kan takamaiman matsalar."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSL Client Certificate required."
msgstr "Ana buƙatar Takardar Shaidar Abokin Ciniki ta SSL."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An internal call to poll() or select() returned error that is not recoverable."
msgstr "Kiran ciki zuwa poll() ko select() ya dawo da kuskuren da ba za a iya gyarawa ba."

